WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.411
Roxy tapped Terrell on the shoulder.

2
00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:17.913
"I'll be back soon," she whispered.

3
00:00:18.453 --> 00:00:20.394
"I have to go to the space station."

4
00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:22.335
Terrell's eyes went wide.

5
00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.576
"Wow! Good luck!"

6
00:00:27.418 --> 00:00:28.959
Roxy hurried away from the playground.

7
00:00:30.219 --> 00:00:31.240
She shot into the sky.

8
00:00:34.816 --> 00:00:35.496
"Look!" Mara pointed.

9
00:00:35.516 --> 00:00:37.617
"Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:39.097 --> 00:00:40.518
Soon Roxy was in space.

11
00:00:43.538 --> 00:00:44.339
Her watch beeped.

12
00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:52.661
Smith," Roxy said.

13
00:00:52.681 --> 00:00:54.562
"Is there a problem on Earth?

14
00:00:55.182 --> 00:00:57.002
Is it being invaded by aliens?"

15
00:00:57.022 --> 00:01:01.163
"No, Rocket Girl," the detective said.

16
00:01:01.183 --> 00:01:03.184
"I just wanted to say good luck.

17
00:01:04.348 --> 00:01:06.989
My brother, Commander Smith, is on the space station.

18
00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:08.770
I hope he's okay."

19
00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.011
"I didn't know you had a brother," Roxy said.

20
00:01:12.852 --> 00:01:13.892
Detective Smith nodded.

21
00:01:13.912 --> 00:01:15.373
"We're twins."

22
00:01:16.953 --> 00:01:18.874
Just then Roxy saw the space station.

23
00:01:18.894 --> 00:01:21.035
"Whew!" she said.

24
00:01:21.055 --> 00:01:23.016
"Good news, Detective.

25
00:01:23.336 --> 00:01:25.317
The space station wasn't destroyed.

26
00:01:26.017 --> 00:01:28.918
I'll find out why the Space Agency lost contact with it."

27
00:01:30.899 --> 00:01:33.200
Roxy closed her watch and entered the space station.

28
00:01:35.048 --> 00:01:35.789
It looked empty.

29
00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:39.571
"Where is everyone?"

30
00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:40.531
Roxy thought.

31
00:01:40.551 --> 00:01:42.973
"And where is all the equipment?"

32
00:01:42.993 --> 00:01:46.054
"Hello?" she called out.

33
00:01:46.074 --> 00:01:47.815
"Is anyone here?"

34
00:01:49.216 --> 00:01:50.977
An astronaut peeked out from a hatch.

35
00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:53.178
Her name tag said Dr.

36
00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:55.660
Chen. "Officer Wells!

37
00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:56.680
Come on out!"

38
00:01:57.081 --> 00:01:57.901
Dr. Chen said.

39
00:01:57.921 --> 00:01:59.742
"Rocket Girl is here!"

40
00:01:59.762 --> 00:02:02.684
A second astronaut came into the room.

41
00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:08.649
"We're so glad you're here, Rocket Girl!"

42
00:02:08.669 --> 00:02:10.509
"What happened?"

43
00:02:10.709 --> 00:02:11.449
Roxy asked.

44
00:02:11.469 --> 00:02:14.470
"The Space Agency lost contact with you."

45
00:02:16.231 --> 00:02:18.571
Dr. Chen looked at Officer Wells and sighed.

46
00:02:18.591 --> 00:02:23.993
"All of our communication equipment is gone," she said.

47
00:02:24.013 --> 00:02:27.294
"Phones, computers gone!"

48
00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:31.015
"I don't understand," Roxy said.

49
00:02:31.035 --> 00:02:33.235
"Where did the equipment go?"

50
00:02:33.255 --> 00:02:37.465
"Well Officer Wells chuckled nervously.

51
00:02:37.485 --> 00:02:41.246
"We found a creature in a spaceship.

52
00:02:41.966 --> 00:02:42.786
He was really cute.

53
00:02:43.106 --> 00:02:43.866
Small and furry.

54
00:02:44.447 --> 00:02:45.347
I named him Furbit.

55
00:02:45.947 --> 00:02:49.108
Unfortunately, um Dr.

56
00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:50.188
Chen glared at him.

57
00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:52.469
"Furbit ate everything!"

58
00:02:53.449 --> 00:02:54.630
Officer Wells looked down.

59
00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.270
"It was my fault.

60
00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:58.831
I brought Furbit into the space station."

61
00:02:59.811 --> 00:03:00.431
He frowned.

62
00:03:00.451 --> 00:03:02.672
"Commander Smith won't be happy."

63
00:03:03.736 --> 00:03:04.776
"Where is the commander?"

64
00:03:04.996 --> 00:03:05.637
Roxy asked.

65
00:03:05.657 --> 00:03:08.017
"I don't know," Dr.

66
00:03:08.077 --> 00:03:08.577
Chen said.

67
00:03:08.597 --> 00:03:10.918
"I looked for him a little while ago.

68
00:03:10.998 --> 00:03:12.098
But I couldn't find him."

69
00:03:12.118 --> 00:03:13.559
"Wait here."

70
00:03:14.059 --> 00:03:15.319
Roxy headed toward a door.

71
00:03:15.339 --> 00:03:17.360
"Where are you going?"

72
00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:18.420
Dr. Chen asked.

73
00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.741
"I'm going to catch Furbit," Roxy said.

74
00:03:22.681 --> 00:03:24.041
Officer Wells looked shocked.

75
00:03:24.642 --> 00:03:25.622
"That won't be easy!"

76
00:03:25.642 --> 00:03:27.302
"What do you mean?"

77
00:03:27.642 --> 00:03:28.303
Roxy asked.

78
00:03:28.323 --> 00:03:30.703
"You said Furbit is small and furry."

79
00:03:31.923 --> 00:03:33.464
Boom! Boom!

80
00:03:34.348 --> 00:03:35.630
The space station shook.

81
00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:38.794
"Oof!" Officer Wells tumbled into Dr.

82
00:03:38.834 --> 00:03:41.057
Chen. Roxy bumped her head.

83
00:03:41.357 --> 00:03:43.700
"What was that?"

84
00:03:44.821 --> 00:03:46.003
Dr. Chen gulped.

85
00:03:46.023 --> 00:03:48.306
"That was Furbit!"
